flowchart TB
    %% Happy path. Search stages are separately dispatched and claimed jobs.
    %% The playback column shows steps within one playback job.
    A["Upload and authorize<br/>Browser + FastAPI"]:::upload --> B["Store raw video<br/>Amazon S3"]:::upload
    B --> C["Commit video and jobs<br/>Postgres transaction"]:::upload
    C --> D["Dispatch pending jobs<br/>Dispatcher to Redis"]:::jobs
    D --> E["Consume and claim jobs<br/>Celery workers + Postgres"]:::jobs

    E -->|Search jobs| F["Extract audio chunks<br/>FFmpeg"]:::search
    F --> G["Transcribe and embed<br/>Index vectors in Qdrant"]:::search
    G --> H["Finalize search results<br/>Accepted chunk artifacts"]:::search

    E -->|Playback job| I["Transcode video<br/>FFmpeg"]:::playback
    I --> J["Create thumbnail<br/>FFmpeg"]:::playback
    J --> L["Publish playback<br/>Amazon S3 + Postgres"]:::playback

    H -->|Search complete| K["Both branches complete<br/>Video status: processed"]:::complete
    L -->|Playback complete| K

    classDef upload fill:#edf4ff,stroke:#468cce,color:#182c48
    classDef jobs fill:#f2edff,stroke:#9470c5,color:#302048
    classDef search fill:#edf8f5,stroke:#37a787,color:#173e33
    classDef playback fill:#fff2e6,stroke:#e59848,color:#523519
    classDef complete fill:#e8f0f6,stroke:#718b9e,color:#233b4d

